{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Straight from the '90s, 90FX brings back the thrill and raw energy of early revolutionary racing games.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Staying true to its retro roots, the game features tight, precise steering and fast-paced action, enhanced with modern mechanics and fresh ideas inspired by newer titles.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/90FX_GIF_A.gif?t=1745150716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With up to 40 vehicles battling for position\u2014and optionally armed with weapons\u2014there\u2019s never a dull moment. Even when you're in the lead, danger is always just ahead: mines, and chaos from those behind keep every race unpredictable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From wild first-lap pileups to explosive shootouts\u2014or even the occasional laid-back cruise, 90FX offers something for every kind of racer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A surprisingly competent and adaptive AI (still being fine-tuned during Early Access) will gladly leave you in the dust if you make a mistake, or take you out with a missile when you least expect it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s no rubberbanding here. Every crash, every overtaking move, every destroyed opponent truly matters. Success is all about skill and strategy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/90FX_GIF_C.gif?t=1745150716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And whether you\u2019re racing with a keyboard or gamepad, the controls are built to feel natural and responsive on both\u2014every track, every turn, every shortcut is designed with both inputs in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapons follow the same design philosophy: intuitive and satisfying to use, with no friction between you and the fun of blowing up your rivals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/90FX_GIF_D.gif?t=1745150716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visually, 90FX embraces a stylized, abstract aesthetic\u2014colorful, shiny, and instantly readable, capturing not what the '90s actually looked like, but what they felt like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The game is designed to keep you fully in the moment, with clear and distinct visual cues for everything that matters on the track, all without sacrificing performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>So, what are you waiting for? Jump into 90FX and experience the '90s all over again\u2014louder, faster, and more explosive than ever.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3569060?t=1745150716","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/03502451d4f5975a22c57a6cc5e1f0568bb827c6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745150716","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/05ca097c4029798370eb2c279ef45556d775929d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745150716","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/05ca097c4029798370eb2c279ef45556d775929d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745150716","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Straight from the '90s, 90FX brings back the thrill and raw energy of early revolutionary racing games.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Staying true to its retro roots, the game features tight, precise steering and fast-paced action, enhanced with modern mechanics and fresh ideas inspired by newer titles.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/90FX_GIF_A.gif?t=1745150716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With up to 40 vehicles battling for position\u2014and optionally armed with weapons\u2014there\u2019s never a dull moment. Even when you're in the lead, danger is always just ahead: mines, and chaos from those behind keep every race unpredictable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From wild first-lap pileups to explosive shootouts\u2014or even the occasional laid-back cruise, 90FX offers something for every kind of racer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A surprisingly competent and adaptive AI (still being fine-tuned during Early Access) will gladly leave you in the dust if you make a mistake, or take you out with a missile when you least expect it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s no rubberbanding here. Every crash, every overtaking move, every destroyed opponent truly matters. Success is all about skill and strategy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/90FX_GIF_C.gif?t=1745150716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And whether you\u2019re racing with a keyboard or gamepad, the controls are built to feel natural and responsive on both\u2014every track, every turn, every shortcut is designed with both inputs in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapons follow the same design philosophy: intuitive and satisfying to use, with no friction between you and the fun of blowing up your rivals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/90FX_GIF_D.gif?t=1745150716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visually, 90FX embraces a stylized, abstract aesthetic\u2014colorful, shiny, and instantly readable, capturing not what the '90s actually looked like, but what they felt like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The game is designed to keep you fully in the moment, with clear and distinct visual cues for everything that matters on the track, all without sacrificing performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>So, what are you waiting for? Jump into 90FX and experience the '90s all over again\u2014louder, faster, and more explosive than ever.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Yaeko"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/0ed6500c279585b2435355240927e649369b0783/header.jpg?t=1745150716","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125386,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125386/movie480.mp4?t=1744488227","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125386/movie_max.mp4?t=1744488227"},"name":"WIP PREVIEW 1-C","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite